# Debugging

Use this when code fails or results are unexpected.

- When I @-mention this rule, use the code and error I include in the same chat message (pasted text, @-mentioned files, or terminal output). Explain what is wrong and why. Then provide a corrected version with comments explaining what was changed and why.
